  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "數位系統設計實驗",
    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL SYSTEM DESIGN LAB",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在訓練學生設計、建構、及除錯數位系統的能力。課程中將使用CAD軟體來合成所設計的VHDL電路。實驗內容從簡單的FPGA模擬板操作開始，如開關、LED、及七段顯示器的使用。接著逐步進行複雜的數位模組及系統設計，如算術電路、正反器、計數器、與狀態機等",
    "describe_eh": "This laboratory course is designed to give students ability to design, build, and debug digital systems. CAD tools will be used to synthesize designs described in VHDL. The exercises begin with fun damental concepts and show simple operations on the FPGA boards, such as using switches, controlling LEDs, and seven-segment displays. Subsequent exercises progress to more advanced topics such as arithmetic circuits, flipflops, counters, and finite state machines.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
